      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For the most part the safety system works petty well in my experience. What may be happening is that the users you are encountering have \"modded clients\" which allows them to appear to you no matter what settings you have. Your real only solution is to block those users until the VRchat team has been able to combat this problem.",
