      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cc8ef132dfd030ccc7c49c3|full_name}: From my experience that doesn't seem to be the case.\nNo matter which player it would still block their avatar even if they were not \"User\" and were Trusted or Known, If they were to swtich avatars it will load normally or if I change a setting on the safety system it would show their avatar like it should but it only happens when you load the instance or they load the instance after you. But according to the open beta update (build 910) that will be fixed.\nNo easy way to test that right now unless i can find people on the beta.",
