  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "No matter the settings can be a custom or one of the default one, the settings you apply to \"User\" are also applied to Known and Trusted which means if you don't allow users avatar to be visible to \"User\" it will also unallows Known and Trusted users avatars to be visible ( On instance join and when they join the instance afterwards).\nIt will update if you refresh by changing any setting on the safety system.",
